#: dictee-setup.py:15033
msgid ""
"RMS level below which the recording is considered silent and transcription "
"is skipped. Prevents ASR hallucinations (parasitic phrases invented on "
"background noise)."
msgstr ""
"Nivel RMS por debajo del cual la grabación se considera en silencio y se "
"omite la transcripción. Evita las alucinaciones del ASR (frases parásitas "
